1
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,170
<i>I told you, didn't I?</i>
[4 years ago]

2
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:29,600
I'm sorry. I promise I won't draw anymore.

3
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,180
Mom, listen...

4
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,990
Hello.

5
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:41,970
Do you draw, too?

6
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,290
Huh?

7
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:49,270
Can I draw you?

8
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:51,990
No. I don't have money.

9
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:01,670
How beautiful...

10
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:04,300
It's called, Eustoma.

11
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,480
"Eustoma"?

12
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:09,800
This flower... it's alive.

13
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,110
Huh?

14
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:14,030
This flower.

15
00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:17,830
Is alive.

16
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:24,440
Okay. Interesting.

17
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:27,780
No one's ever said that before.

18
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:29,610
You're the first.

19
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:40,900
Present, for you.

20
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,760
No, I can't. No.

21
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,730
It's okay. Take it.

22
00:01:44,730 --> 00:01:46,670
I want you to have it.

23
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,940
Thank you.

24
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:51,960
Thank you.

25
00:01:53,770 --> 00:01:58,120
This painting, it makes me feel like
I can travel far away.

26
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:04,040
I'll come again.

27
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:08,270
I mean... come back.

28
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:10,580
Come back? You'll come back?

29
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:13,040
- Yes!
- Okay.

30
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,330
I'll see you then.

31
00:02:14,330 --> 00:02:16,670
- See you.
- Bye bye.

32
00:02:37,770 --> 00:02:39,870
- You like Eustomas?
- Huh?

33
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:47,580
I come here often for flowers.

34
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:49,670
"Come here"...

35
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:54,330
Do you like flowers?

36
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:11,280
You feel at peace when you have flowers.

37
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:13,340
I like flowers.

38
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:18,660
Maybe... first time.

39
00:03:19,530 --> 00:03:21,700
First time?

40
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:25,460
I like flowers now.

41
00:03:27,230 --> 00:03:29,470
You're a strange one, huh?

42
00:03:31,370 --> 00:03:32,800
Nothing.

43
00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:37,350
You just insulted me, didn't you?

44
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:47,220
Rain is gonna stop soon.

45
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,540
It'll stop, soon?

46
00:03:51,950 --> 00:03:56,290
"Stop, soon"?

47
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:03,180
- Hey, you wanna run?
- Huh?

48
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:05,650
My studio is nearby.

49
00:04:05,650 --> 00:04:07,750
You don't want it to get wet, right?

50
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:14,990
- Come on, let's go!
- What?

51
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:30,170
You're all wet!

52
00:04:31,060 --> 00:04:33,630
Let's go. Let's go.

53
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,090
Told you to be careful!

54
00:04:43,090 --> 00:04:45,970
- You didn't!
- "You didn't"!

55
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:47,600
Let's go.

56
00:04:56,480 --> 00:05:00,220
Sorry. I painted you without asking.

57
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:02,100
No, it's fine.

58
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:05,490
So this is what I look like to you.

59
00:05:05,490 --> 00:05:08,560
It feels alive, right?

60
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,970
Yeah.

61
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:15,220
Can I paint you again?

62
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,890
Can I, too?

63
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:23,310
Me?

64
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:25,250
You want to paint me?

65
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:26,590
Yeah?

66
00:05:40,550 --> 00:05:43,010
I'm back.

67
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:12,400
[Soak the dishes before washing]

68
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,400
[Don't put laundry away
while it's still damp]

69
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:21,620
- "I'm sorry"?
- Yup.

70
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:23,600
I'm very sorry.

71
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,030
"I'm very sorry".

72
00:06:25,030 --> 00:06:26,260
What does it mean?

73
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:28,570
"Rain stop".

74
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:33,990
Ah! Don't worry, it will let up soon.

75
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:48,410
What are you doing?

76
00:06:49,550 --> 00:06:51,790
Practicing my signature.

77
00:06:51,790 --> 00:06:56,030
I'm trying to perfect it,
but... something's missing.

78
00:07:07,170 --> 00:07:08,830
How's that?
[Lun]

79
00:07:10,350 --> 00:07:11,560
Sakura?

80
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:14,340
Yeah!

81
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:17,720
It's pretty. Pretty!

82
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,310
Xiu Fang.

83
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:20,680
Help keep this for me.

84
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:23,750
Whenever we come for coffee,
serve our drinks on this.

85
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:25,000
On a disposable coaster?

86
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,850
Not just any coaster.

87
00:07:26,850 --> 00:07:30,110
A coaster, featuring my very first autograph.

88
00:07:30,110 --> 00:07:35,610
Fine, then I'll keep it around
until you hit it big as an artist.

89
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:39,260
Here you go. For them.

90
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:41,240
Okay.

91
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:47,120
Hey!

92
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,970
- Chili?
- Thank you.

93
00:07:58,660 --> 00:08:01,400
Bon appétit!

94
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:08,400
Not watching?

95
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:10,590
I am.

96
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:16,450
But this is more beautiful.

97
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,670
Don't make this a painting.

98
00:08:30,670 --> 00:08:32,150
Why?

99
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:38,010
Let's watch together.

100
00:08:38,010 --> 00:08:39,350
Okay.

101
00:08:54,910 --> 00:08:56,980
Didn't you sleep?

102
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,170
A little.

103
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:08,250
I'm afraid if I sleep, I might forget.

104
00:09:08,250 --> 00:09:10,390
Forget, what?

105
00:09:17,190 --> 00:09:18,930
Your face.

106
00:09:21,020 --> 00:09:22,950
You won't.

107
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:24,840
You don't know that.

108
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,810
Then...

109
00:09:42,950 --> 00:09:45,960
Please, don't forget.

110
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:55,810
I won't.

111
00:11:28,340 --> 00:11:30,430
No, no, no.

112
00:11:30,930 --> 00:11:32,570
It's not it.

113
00:11:33,370 --> 00:11:37,640
It's not it. It's not it!

114
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,070
Why?

115
00:11:46,070 --> 00:11:48,000
Why?

116
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,980
Why?

117
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,790
Why?

118
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:05,360
Why can't I paint it anymore?

119
00:12:12,090 --> 00:12:14,620
- Why?
- Lun?

120
00:12:16,230 --> 00:12:17,730
Lun!

121
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:21,360
I'm going crazy.

122
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:23,620
I'm going crazy!

123
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:27,790
I can't paint without you...

124
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:34,470
I can't paint without you!

125
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:44,520
No, no, no.

126
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:47,800
Without you, I'm nothing.

127
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:51,400
How did I even live
before you came into my life?

128
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:54,160
Sakura.

129
00:12:55,350 --> 00:12:59,970
You'll never leave me, right?

130
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:03,110
Sakura.

131
00:13:03,110 --> 00:13:04,480
Why?

132
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:08,010
Tell me, Sakura...

133
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:12,550
Are you going back to Japan?

134
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,060
Yeah.

135
00:13:27,170 --> 00:13:29,420
When are you coming back again?

136
00:13:31,010 --> 00:13:32,810
I don't know.

137
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:53,420
Do you want to draw?

138
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:00,050
No.

139
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:03,390
So you draw, when I cry.

140
00:14:09,050 --> 00:14:10,670
Sakura.

141
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:17,010
I'm sorry.

142
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:06,680
Did you show her this painting?

143
00:15:11,970 --> 00:15:13,380
Not yet.

144
00:15:15,090 --> 00:15:17,020
Then don't.

145
00:15:19,970 --> 00:15:22,050
Why not?

146
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:26,880
You create your best pieces

147
00:15:30,180 --> 00:15:32,280
when she breaks apart.

148
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,800
That's not true.

149
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:44,150
I'm going to include this in my exhibition.

150
00:15:47,310 --> 00:15:49,220
- You can't.
- Why not?

151
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:51,630
This is my painting.

152
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:54,000
It's her life.

153
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:24,810
Why are you here?

154
00:16:50,710 --> 00:16:53,010
You don't have to look at that painting.

155
00:16:54,170 --> 00:16:55,810
Sakura.

156
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,070
How beautiful.

157
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:19,950
So this is what I looked like.

158
00:17:22,070 --> 00:17:24,790
I'm just a painting to you.

159
00:17:26,230 --> 00:17:27,670
No.

160
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:32,180
I just wanted to keep you.

161
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:36,000
Why?

162
00:17:36,650 --> 00:17:38,590
Because I'm afraid...

163
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:43,080
you might disappear one day.

164
00:17:47,650 --> 00:17:49,370
With you...

165
00:17:50,270 --> 00:17:51,390
I felt alive.

166
00:17:51,390 --> 00:17:53,940
- Then why?
- But.

167
00:17:53,940 --> 00:17:56,520
My pain feeds your art.

168
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:59,800
No. That's not true.

169
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:08,390
What's next? Smiling?

170
00:18:11,050 --> 00:18:13,450
I can't paint without you.

171
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:18,520
That isn't love.

172
00:18:21,890 --> 00:18:23,970
Live.

173
00:18:23,970 --> 00:18:26,390
Even without painting.

174
00:18:30,610 --> 00:18:33,060
You want me to live?

175
00:18:34,150 --> 00:18:36,010
Without you?

176
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:09,420
Good bye.

177
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:14,550
You can't say that.

178
00:19:16,810 --> 00:19:18,380
Sakura.

179
00:19:19,150 --> 00:19:21,440
At least let me drive you home.

180
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:26,200
<i>Where did we go wrong?</i>

181
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,580
<i>Maybe we should never have met.</i>

182
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:31,040
<i>Don't say that.</i>

183
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:34,580
<i>I could paint for the first time
after you came.</i>

184
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:36,840
<i>And I could feel alive with you.</i>

185
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:39,020
<i>Then why?</i>

186
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:42,330
<i>When I go home,
I think I'll feel relieved.</i>

187
00:19:42,330 --> 00:19:44,950
<i>Because you'll be away from me?</i>

188
00:19:44,950 --> 00:19:46,380
<i>Yeah.</i>

189
00:19:47,610 --> 00:19:53,320
<i>But at the same time,
I'm scared of the relief I'll feel.</i>

190
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:55,390
<i>Do you still love me?</i>

191
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:59,360
Let me out here.

192
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:01,730
Here?

193
00:20:01,730 --> 00:20:04,160
If I stay,

194
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:06,300
I'll come back to you.

195
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:08,410
Then stay with me.

196
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:24,380
Sakura!

197
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:54,910
He may not be able to draw again.

198
00:21:03,850 --> 00:21:05,650
Please...

199
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:11,380
Please, stay away from him.

200
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:17,070
If you stay, he will break.

201
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,620
Lun...

202
00:21:36,010 --> 00:21:37,610
You're awake?

203
00:21:38,370 --> 00:21:40,210
Do you want to sit up?

204
00:21:53,010 --> 00:21:55,030
You are...

205
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,970
Sorry.

206
00:21:59,970 --> 00:22:02,930
Who are you?

207
00:22:12,370 --> 00:22:14,060
I...

208
00:22:15,350 --> 00:22:20,260
I felt relieved.

209
00:22:20,260 --> 00:22:22,450
Relieved, that he forgot.

210
00:22:31,860 --> 00:22:35,440
But Lun protected me.

211
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:40,240
I'm the worst.

212
00:22:41,390 --> 00:22:49,640
[Next]
